# Decisions

The structural decisions in force in this project, one file per
decision, `<slug>.md`, no numbering. Each has four sections: Context,
Decision, Consequences, Rejected alternatives. A decision that changes
is rewritten as a new file; the old one is deleted and its option moves
to the Rejected alternatives of the new one.

